2186111644 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186111877 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111645 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111646 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111645 #edb/ref 1061 455955 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111645 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "da9135a3-0714-5821-9342-7af0dfdc24c1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111645 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110696 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111646 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111647 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111646 #edb/ref 1061 455958 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111646 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "70bdbc7f-5a0f-5a93-968c-2aea21b191b2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111646 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110697 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111647 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186111648 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111647 #edb/ref 1061 455961 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111647 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "43bc1a3b-9e83-53c1-a693-6ff91e1f9a45" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111647 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110698 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111648 #edb/ref 1061 455964 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111648 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "77cd3268-d65f-5cf1-8123-2cf48af729df" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111648 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186110699 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111877 #edb/ref 1064 "We can simplify the addition of two logarithms that share a base using the **product rule** for logarithms.\n\nThe **product rule** states that two logarithms which share a common base $\\color{blue}n$ satisfy\n\n$$\n\\log_{\\color{blue}n}(a) + \\log_{\\color{blue}n}(b) = \\log_{\\color{blue}n}\\left(ab\\right)\n$$\n\nSo, we can use the product rule to rewrite $\\log_{\\color{blue}5}(4) + \\log_{\\color{blue}5}(3)$ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\log_{5} 4 + \\log_{5} (3) &= \\log_{5} (4 \\cdot 3) \\\\\n&= \\log_{5} (12)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe product rule works exactly the same for the natural and common logarithms." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111877 #edb/ref 1065 2782 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111877 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "a915130a-f6b9-5fec-a625-3d6d987255ac" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186111877 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
